    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the silence is actually loud. it's heavy. people keep telling me to \"find a new hobby\" or \"reconnect with friends\" but they don't get it. i don't have a personality. i was just a caregiver. now that the job is done, there's just this massive, empty space where my whole life used to be. i feel like i'm just waiting for the lights to go out.",
